> 
> Fix wrap around for pos errors on addresses above 32 bit.
> 
> Reported-by: kbuild test robot <lkp@intel.com>
> Signed-off-by: Talel Shenhar <talel@amazon.com>
> ---
>  drivers/soc/amazon/al_pos.c | 2 +-
